    {
      "id": "claim_dd105c827d06438fa58b1611c63cc4bd",
      "statement": "createClient(), getCatalogMap(), and getCurrentBodyweight() are each wrapped in React cache(), so within one request layout, page, and Server Action call sites that pass the same client instance share one query per underlying table instead of one per call site.",
