    {
      "id": "claim_b2c09177afdb4bd19d3546ac477a50a6",
      "statement": "React cache() memoizes by argument identity, so the shared, request-memoized Supabase client instance from createClient() is what allows getCatalogMap and getCurrentBodyweight to dedupe across different callers in the same request; if each caller built its own client the dedup would not occur.",
      "evidence": [
