      "statement": "Mutation Server Actions call revalidatePath() for every route their write could affect immediately after the write/cache-rebuild completes, e.g. logSet revalidates the session route, its recap route, and the per-exercise history route, while other actions in the same file revalidate /, /analytics, /analytics/month, /analytics/volume, /analytics/coach, and /program as appropriate.",
